OK, I think I got it after all - should have tried a few other things before posting....

If I replace:
        N[1] ~ dnorm(20,sd=2)

with
inN ~ dnorm(20,sd=2)
N[1] <- inN

and provide initial values for inN instead of N, then it seems to work.

