From udd632bd3bbcdd7e9 at groups.google.com  Thu Jul 25 01:36:10 2019
From: udd632bd3bbcdd7e9 at groups.google.com (Perry de Valpine)
Date: Thu, 25 Jul 2019 01:36:10 +0000
